The project contains modified components that were originally developed by Ginger Bill, for the odin programming language, released under BSD 3-Clause License. These were modified by me to accomodate the new language and are:
1. the lexer
2. the parser
3. the typechecker

The modifications include:
1. Translation from C++ to Odin where necesary
2. Addition of extra syntax 
3. Removal of unneeded syntax

The code structure remains largely the same. 

